+2. **Frequency Levels:** A set of $L_{freq}$ frequency levels. Each level $l$ defines a set of sinusoidal basis functions [G].
 
 **Parameters:**
--   $L_{hash}$: Number of hash grid levels. Default: 16 [S1].
--   $L_{freq}$: Number of frequency levels. Swept values: 2, 4, 8, 16. Optimal: 8 [S1].
